          "text": "As inventor William Petty observed, “When a new invention is first put forward, in the beginning every man objects...not one of a hundred (inventor) outlives this torture.” This was true for vaccinations (疫苗) and railroads, which all met strong resistance, just as anxieties now surround innovations like AI.",
